    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Tier 4 (Level 17) — The Hanged Man</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Tactical:</strong> —</li><li><strong>Strategic:</strong> Once per strategic turn, after a failed raid, intrigue action, or diplomatic action, your faction may immediately regain <strong>1 spent OP</strong> of the type used and apply <strong>+1</strong> to its next related strategic roll.</li></ul><div data-ft-per-use=\"1\" data-ft-per-use-key=\"hangedT4\" style=\"margin-top:0.7rem;padding:0.55rem 0.75rem;border:1px solid #b08acc;border-radius:0.35rem;background:rgba(70,55,95,0.18);\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:0.78rem;letter-spacing:0.04em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#d4b8e8;margin-bottom:0.25rem\">⟁ Per-Use Ability — <strong>Sacrifice Refund</strong></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:0.86rem;opacity:0.92;line-height:1.4\"><strong>Recovery:</strong> 1/Strategic Turn &nbsp;·&nbsp; <strong>Action:</strong> Strategic (after failed action) &nbsp;·&nbsp; <strong>Use:</strong> Click this feature on your sheet to invoke.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:0.82rem;opacity:0.85;margin-top:0.3rem\">After a failed raid / intrigue / diplomatic action, regain 1 spent OP of the type used and apply +1 to the next related strategic roll.</div>\n</div>",
